1
00:01:42,439 --> 00:01:43,480
You're all here.

2
00:01:45,439 --> 00:01:46,879
I won't bother you, then.

3
00:01:52,560 --> 00:01:53,359
What's going on?

4
00:01:54,040 --> 00:01:55,519
Why the sudden good mood?

5
00:01:56,239 --> 00:01:57,040
What happened?

6
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:00,799
It's a secret.

7
00:02:01,079 --> 00:02:02,719
Come on, tell us what happened.

8
00:02:03,799 --> 00:02:04,879
Well, last night...

9
00:02:05,040 --> 00:02:07,879
someone got kicked out by Anda.

10
00:02:08,080 --> 00:02:08,919
Yeah.

11
00:02:08,960 --> 00:02:11,800
Someone got kicked out

12
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:12,759
by a very resentful lady.

13
00:02:13,680 --> 00:02:14,960
Let me tell you,

14
00:02:15,080 --> 00:02:16,520
you guys just don't get it.

15
00:02:16,680 --> 00:02:18,479
A woman's mind is hard to read.

16
00:02:18,560 --> 00:02:21,520
To figure her out, you need serious game.

17
00:02:22,080 --> 00:02:22,879
See ya.

18
00:02:23,840 --> 00:02:25,520
Zuo Feichen, where are you going?

19
00:02:25,879 --> 00:02:26,919
It's his day off today.

20
00:02:29,520 --> 00:02:30,680
What's he so busy with?

21
00:02:31,479 --> 00:02:33,319
He disappears right after work lately.

22
00:02:34,879 --> 00:02:36,120
Could he be planning

23
00:02:36,159 --> 00:02:38,080
to open a Casablanca branch here?

24
00:02:39,080 --> 00:02:40,159
You never know.

25
00:02:40,879 --> 00:02:43,240
You can only keep running forward,

26
00:02:43,560 --> 00:02:44,680
unable to hear a thing,

27
00:02:44,800 --> 00:02:46,479
hearing only your own heartbeat,

28
00:02:46,479 --> 00:02:47,919
and your mind goes totally blank.

29
00:02:47,960 --> 00:02:50,039
So that's what falling in love in Africa feels like.

30
00:02:50,159 --> 00:02:50,960
No.

31
00:02:52,360 --> 00:02:55,319
That's what being kidnapped in Africa feels like.

32
00:02:56,439 --> 00:02:57,280
Still, President Dan,

33
00:02:57,280 --> 00:02:59,639
I'd really like to know who started this gossip.

34
00:02:59,759 --> 00:03:01,919
You never used to gossip about things like this.

35
00:03:02,280 --> 00:03:04,360
I don't gossip about this kind of stuff now either.

36
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:05,520
Then who was it?

37
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:07,280
How should I know?

38
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:12,319
Though this time, I do want some gossip.

39
00:03:12,680 --> 00:03:14,120
I really want to know

40
00:03:14,400 --> 00:03:18,159
what it feels like to live day in, day out

41
00:03:18,240 --> 00:03:20,039
with a Silent Protector

42
00:03:20,319 --> 00:03:21,520
as tough as a commando.

43
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:28,520
Well, you learn things like

44
00:03:28,800 --> 00:03:31,680
what spiked wine tastes like,

45
00:03:31,680 --> 00:03:33,560
how long a sip knocks you out,

46
00:03:34,639 --> 00:03:37,680
how to escape if terrorists capture you,

47
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:40,919
and if you meet someone with a knife,

48
00:03:40,960 --> 00:03:41,759
how to defend yourself.

49
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:44,439
That's enough to remember for a lifetime.

50
00:03:47,319 --> 00:03:48,879
Not bad, Anda.

51
00:03:59,120 --> 00:04:00,120
Wipe it down well.

52
00:04:05,840 --> 00:04:07,520
This is way too gorgeous!

53
00:04:07,960 --> 00:04:09,400
It's... it's just perfect.

54
00:04:09,400 --> 00:04:10,439
This is a work of art!

55
00:04:10,439 --> 00:04:11,639
A work of art, bro!

56
00:04:11,879 --> 00:04:12,919
Can you tell me

57
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:14,680
how you actually pulled this off?

58
00:04:15,800 --> 00:04:16,720
I couldn't do it myself.

59
00:04:16,759 --> 00:04:18,079
I brought in an expert.

60
00:04:20,240 --> 00:04:21,480
This... this is...

61
00:04:21,680 --> 00:04:22,560
my goddess.

62
00:04:23,360 --> 00:04:24,279
I'm Ye Wan.

63
00:04:25,199 --> 00:04:26,000
So you're saying

64
00:04:26,279 --> 00:04:28,519
that pile of rusty old parts earlier

65
00:04:28,639 --> 00:04:30,040
looking brand new like this

66
00:04:30,279 --> 00:04:31,279
is all thanks to Ms. Ye...

67
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:34,279
thanks to the lovely Ms. Ye?

68
00:04:34,959 --> 00:04:36,560
You can just call me Rosie.

69
00:04:38,839 --> 00:04:39,639
Bro.

70
00:04:40,120 --> 00:04:40,920
Bro.

71
00:04:41,839 --> 00:04:43,920
Bro, earlier you said

72
00:04:44,079 --> 00:04:45,560
it was all her doing

73
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:47,120
just to flatter sister-in-law, right?

74
00:04:48,399 --> 00:04:49,639
Smart boy.

75
00:04:50,040 --> 00:04:51,519
It's so gorgeous.

76
00:04:52,279 --> 00:04:53,120
What we did

77
00:04:53,199 --> 00:04:55,279
was use high-pressure blasting

78
00:04:55,399 --> 00:04:57,120
to strip away from these old parts

79
00:04:57,120 --> 00:05:00,120
decades of accumulated rust and paint,

80
00:05:00,120 --> 00:05:01,560
getting rid of it completely.

81
00:05:02,199 --> 00:05:03,519
This bike right now

82
00:05:03,639 --> 00:05:06,680
is one hundred percent original.

83
00:05:07,120 --> 00:05:08,639
You can sell it for a great price.

84
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:11,800
Impressive, right?

85
00:05:14,079 --> 00:05:16,480
And here I thought you knew everything.

86
00:05:16,560 --> 00:05:18,680
Turns out you were faking it all along!

87
00:05:19,759 --> 00:05:20,879
Stop talking so much.

88
00:05:21,240 --> 00:05:22,519
Isn't it enough that it's fixed?

89
00:05:22,680 --> 00:05:23,720
Besides,

90
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:26,199
what does it matter if she knows and I don't?

91
00:05:26,199 --> 00:05:28,879
We're together, after all.

92
00:05:29,879 --> 00:05:30,720
Right?

93
00:05:31,000 --> 00:05:32,519
Then... could I ask,

94
00:05:32,800 --> 00:05:34,839
how do you know so much about this?

95
00:05:36,839 --> 00:05:38,000
The Danish designer,

96
00:05:38,000 --> 00:05:40,360
Jorgen Skafte Rasmussen,

97
00:05:40,600 --> 00:05:41,839
created the Little Wonder,

98
00:05:42,480 --> 00:05:44,639
and in the 1920s,

99
00:05:44,839 --> 00:05:47,160
the world's largest motorcycle maker.

100
00:05:48,279 --> 00:05:51,279
Zuo Feichen took photos of every part

101
00:05:51,279 --> 00:05:53,720
and sent them to me.

102
00:05:54,079 --> 00:05:56,519
I specifically told him to buy that one.

103
00:05:57,839 --> 00:05:58,639
Right.

104
00:06:01,360 --> 00:06:03,680
Why is there a cup inside the fuel cap?

105
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:05,720
That's no ordinary cup.

106
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:08,079
This engine is a two-stroke,

107
00:06:08,120 --> 00:06:09,879
so to start and run,

108
00:06:09,879 --> 00:06:12,319
it needs a mixture of oil and fuel.

109
00:06:12,839 --> 00:06:14,079
This little cup

110
00:06:14,160 --> 00:06:16,120
is built into the fuel cap.

111
00:06:16,279 --> 00:06:18,839
It lets you accurately and easily measure

112
00:06:18,879 --> 00:06:21,040
how much oil is needed in the fuel.

113
00:06:22,240 --> 00:06:23,040
Impressive, huh?

114
00:06:23,040 --> 00:06:25,680
Sister-in-law, you're amazing!

115
00:06:25,680 --> 00:06:27,079
Totally mind-blowing!

116
00:06:27,879 --> 00:06:28,759
Sister-in-law...

117
00:06:35,120 --> 00:06:36,279
Don't talk nonsense.

118
00:06:36,959 --> 00:06:37,759
This...

119
00:06:38,120 --> 00:06:38,920
Boss Zuo...

120
00:06:38,959 --> 00:06:39,759
Sister-in-law...

121
00:06:42,480 --> 00:06:43,480
It's... it's fine.

122
00:06:43,480 --> 00:06:44,639
I'll tell him to watch it next time.

123
00:06:44,959 --> 00:06:45,759
Don't talk nonsense.

124
00:06:46,120 --> 00:06:46,879
Just say it behind her back.

125
00:06:46,879 --> 00:06:48,160
Don't be so blatant.

126
00:06:48,279 --> 00:06:49,160
She'll get embarrassed.

127
00:06:56,879 --> 00:06:57,920
They say with this tea,

128
00:06:58,879 --> 00:07:01,959
the 1st brew is fragrant, the 2nd bold,

129
00:07:02,879 --> 00:07:04,040
and by the third and fourth,

130
00:07:06,279 --> 00:07:07,639
a delicate fragrance still lingers.

131
00:07:08,319 --> 00:07:09,120
Have a taste.

132
00:07:10,439 --> 00:07:12,839
Being abroad all year, I only drank coffee.

133
00:07:13,040 --> 00:07:15,480
I've almost forgotten how tea tastes.

134
00:07:15,959 --> 00:07:17,519
Then I guess it's wasted on me.

135
00:07:23,600 --> 00:07:24,399
Not bad.

136
00:07:26,279 --> 00:07:27,839
Means you haven't forgotten your roots.

137
00:07:35,879 --> 00:07:37,959
You're always so busy, Mr. Xiang,

138
00:07:39,160 --> 00:07:41,519
yet you have time to invite me for tea.

139
00:07:43,040 --> 00:07:44,959
Did you land a big contract?

140
00:07:45,000 --> 00:07:46,120
Just tell me what's on your mind.

141
00:07:48,160 --> 00:07:49,360
You hit the nail on the head.

142
00:07:51,879 --> 00:07:53,839
We landed a big deal with Zhonggang Corp.

143
00:07:54,879 --> 00:07:57,160
Providing security in Supedo.

144
00:07:58,879 --> 00:08:01,319
I'd like you to call Wei Tian

145
00:08:02,439 --> 00:08:04,759
and ask him to help us out.

146
00:08:05,560 --> 00:08:06,879
Did I hear that right?

147
00:08:07,759 --> 00:08:09,360
You want me to call him?

148
00:08:09,360 --> 00:08:09,680
Yes.

149
00:08:09,680 --> 00:08:10,879
Given the history between you two,

150
00:08:10,879 --> 00:08:12,279
you're asking me to call him?

151
00:08:14,040 --> 00:08:15,279
To tell you the truth,

152
00:08:16,480 --> 00:08:17,959
I already did.

153
00:08:18,759 --> 00:08:19,519
But...

154
00:08:20,399 --> 00:08:23,720
he made excuses and turned me down.

155
00:08:25,199 --> 00:08:27,040
Maybe he's tied up with something else?

156
00:08:27,519 --> 00:08:28,279
Why not give it some time?

157
00:08:30,399 --> 00:08:32,480
He said he had other things going on,

158
00:08:33,039 --> 00:08:34,159
but as far as I know,

159
00:08:35,759 --> 00:08:36,919
he did consider it.

160
00:08:37,120 --> 00:08:39,559
He's just hesitating.

161
00:08:40,159 --> 00:08:43,279
So give him a call

162
00:08:43,919 --> 00:08:44,919
and give him a little push.

163
00:08:45,960 --> 00:08:47,080
Mr. Xiang,

164
00:08:47,279 --> 00:08:49,960
no, you think too highly of me.

165
00:08:50,080 --> 00:08:53,240
Does he ever... does he ever listen to me?

166
00:08:54,279 --> 00:08:57,279
Lao Qu, according to him,

167
00:08:57,799 --> 00:08:59,720
you two share a life-and-death friendship.

168
00:09:00,480 --> 00:09:03,720
He'll take your words seriously.

169
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:05,639
No, no, no, not necessarily.

170
00:09:06,080 --> 00:09:08,720
That man is far too stubborn.

171
00:09:08,960 --> 00:09:10,720
Everyone knows how stubborn he is.

172
00:09:10,759 --> 00:09:11,919
He doesn't listen to anyone.

173
00:09:14,000 --> 00:09:17,519
Lao Qu, how would you describe our bond?

174
00:09:18,440 --> 00:09:19,240
Pretty solid.

175
00:09:19,480 --> 00:09:20,919
Back in Antilocaris,

176
00:09:21,480 --> 00:09:24,360
if not for you, I'd have died many times.

177
00:09:24,679 --> 00:09:25,919
It was nothing, really.

178
00:09:26,879 --> 00:09:29,440
We also share a life-and-death friendship.

179
00:09:30,639 --> 00:09:32,279
In the eyes of my two kids,

180
00:09:33,080 --> 00:09:34,559
you're a true hero.

181
00:09:36,440 --> 00:09:40,039
They are full of respect for Uncle Qu.

182
00:09:40,720 --> 00:09:45,840
So consider this me begging you, brother.

183
00:09:46,639 --> 00:09:49,080
Don't, Mr. Xiang. Please don't beg me.

184
00:09:49,080 --> 00:09:50,080
I'm telling you the truth.

185
00:09:50,080 --> 00:09:52,799
Even if I wanted to help, I can't now.

186
00:09:52,799 --> 00:09:54,840
I don't even have his phone number.

187
00:09:54,919 --> 00:09:56,879
I don't even know where he is.

188
00:09:56,879 --> 00:09:58,960
We haven't been in touch since my return.

189
00:09:59,080 --> 00:10:00,600
You don't even have his contact info?

190
00:10:00,600 --> 00:10:01,399
No, definitely not.

191
00:10:02,639 --> 00:10:03,480
I really don't.

192
00:10:03,480 --> 00:10:04,279
I swear.

193
00:10:04,679 --> 00:10:05,559
I have it right here.

194
00:10:12,039 --> 00:10:12,840
This is the one.

195
00:10:13,440 --> 00:10:14,519
Guaranteed.

196
00:10:16,679 --> 00:10:18,759
I just spoke with him yesterday.

197
00:10:21,440 --> 00:10:22,240
Traitor.

198
00:10:23,240 --> 00:10:24,159
Talking about me?

199
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:28,320
I'm talking about myself.

200
00:10:34,279 --> 00:10:35,080
Anda.

201
00:10:35,440 --> 00:10:36,519
What are you doing here?

202
00:10:37,639 --> 00:10:38,440
I...

203
00:10:41,159 --> 00:10:42,080
What on earth happened?

204
00:10:45,720 --> 00:10:46,679
How did you get hurt?

205
00:10:48,200 --> 00:10:49,720
Let's go over there.

206
00:10:55,080 --> 00:10:56,159
What's going on?

207
00:11:01,600 --> 00:11:03,440
He used to treat me so well.

208
00:11:04,559 --> 00:11:06,080
He brought me breakfast every day,

209
00:11:06,720 --> 00:11:08,080
sent me flowers every day,

210
00:11:09,240 --> 00:11:10,720
and picked me up from work every day.

211
00:11:11,799 --> 00:11:14,240
My family opposed our relationship,

212
00:11:15,679 --> 00:11:17,279
but I married him anyway.

213
00:11:19,519 --> 00:11:20,639
After the wedding,

214
00:11:22,039 --> 00:11:23,720
his family wasn't well-off,

215
00:11:25,600 --> 00:11:26,879
and he didn't earn any money.

216
00:11:28,840 --> 00:11:32,480
We lived entirely off my restaurant.

217
00:11:33,799 --> 00:11:38,279
Over time, he grew cold toward me.

218
00:11:44,039 --> 00:11:45,600
He even started bringing other women

219
00:11:45,600 --> 00:11:46,840
straight into our home.

220
00:11:46,840 --> 00:11:47,519
I...

221
00:11:49,360 --> 00:11:51,080
When I called him out, he beat me.

222
00:11:52,759 --> 00:11:54,360
When he had no money, he beat me.

223
00:11:56,679 --> 00:11:58,240
When he was in a bad mood, he beat me.

224
00:11:59,879 --> 00:12:02,519
I really don't know how to go on living.

225
00:12:10,840 --> 00:12:12,919
Divorce. You have to get a divorce.

226
00:12:16,200 --> 00:12:17,080
A divorce?

227
00:12:19,159 --> 00:12:20,080
How can I?

228
00:12:23,080 --> 00:12:24,720
What about the child if we divorce?

229
00:12:27,440 --> 00:12:28,480
What about him?

230
00:12:29,720 --> 00:12:31,360
He beat you up like this,

231
00:12:31,360 --> 00:12:32,480
and you still care about him?

232
00:12:32,679 --> 00:12:34,679
But I think he still loves me.

233
00:12:35,360 --> 00:12:36,519
Is this love?

234
00:12:36,679 --> 00:12:37,840
Is this how he loves you?

235
00:12:38,960 --> 00:12:40,840
But he still needs me.

236
00:12:43,399 --> 00:12:45,440
Anda, I...

237
00:12:48,039 --> 00:12:49,320
I came to you hoping you could

238
00:12:49,320 --> 00:12:50,759
help me figure out a way

239
00:12:51,799 --> 00:12:54,279
to make him stop beating me.

240
00:12:58,200 --> 00:12:59,159
The way I see it,

241
00:13:00,600 --> 00:13:02,559
this isn't just about your relationship.

242
00:13:03,240 --> 00:13:04,919
This is a serious legal issue.

243
00:13:05,559 --> 00:13:07,679
What he's doing is a crime.

244
00:13:08,960 --> 00:13:10,240
Is it really that serious?

245
00:13:10,480 --> 00:13:11,559
Very serious.

246
00:13:16,360 --> 00:13:18,240
Is that why you joined the training class?

247
00:13:20,200 --> 00:13:21,240
Does he know?

248
00:13:23,039 --> 00:13:24,320
I didn't dare tell him.

249
00:13:30,879 --> 00:13:31,679
Here's what we'll do.

250
00:13:32,559 --> 00:13:34,879
Xiang Bei will teach you self-defense.

251
00:13:41,080 --> 00:13:42,080
Go on inside first.

252
00:13:45,240 --> 00:13:46,039
Mr. Xiao.

253
00:13:58,279 --> 00:13:59,080
Xiao Chuan.

254
00:14:03,639 --> 00:14:04,440
President Dan.

255
00:14:04,759 --> 00:14:07,159
What are you staring at during work hours?

256
00:14:07,480 --> 00:14:08,320
Right, exactly.

257
00:14:08,320 --> 00:14:09,000
It's work hours, after all.

258
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:10,159
I'm looking for Anda.

259
00:14:10,279 --> 00:14:11,919
Look, during work hours, Anda...

260
00:14:11,919 --> 00:14:13,879
Where did she go?

261
00:14:14,840 --> 00:14:16,080
She's in charge of the exhibition.

262
00:14:16,200 --> 00:14:17,519
She should be in the hall.

263
00:14:23,440 --> 00:14:24,960
Why are you looking at me like that?

264
00:14:26,600 --> 00:14:27,399
Well...

265
00:14:28,559 --> 00:14:31,559
I heard since Anda returned from Africa,

266
00:14:32,559 --> 00:14:34,720
she's been quite close to you.

267
00:14:36,159 --> 00:14:37,440
I'm just curious...

268
00:14:38,039 --> 00:14:39,480
who could be so idle

269
00:14:39,519 --> 00:14:41,080
as to not focus on their job

270
00:14:41,440 --> 00:14:43,080
and spread this kind of gossip?

271
00:14:43,840 --> 00:14:45,000
I think HR

272
00:14:45,000 --> 00:14:47,080
should call a staff meeting.

273
00:14:48,039 --> 00:14:48,840
Right, of course.

274
00:14:49,440 --> 00:14:51,080
They really should talk to people.

275
00:14:52,000 --> 00:14:53,039
By the way, President Dan,

276
00:14:53,559 --> 00:14:55,720
there's a business trip this weekend.

277
00:14:55,759 --> 00:14:58,519
I was going to recommend Anda,

278
00:14:59,399 --> 00:15:02,279
but President Sun really appreciates you.

279
00:15:02,759 --> 00:15:04,480
So, following President Sun's wishes,

280
00:15:04,480 --> 00:15:05,720
I brought it up.

281
00:15:05,720 --> 00:15:06,919
And then I... I...

282
00:15:06,919 --> 00:15:10,039
Xiao Chuan, just mind your own business.

283
00:15:10,799 --> 00:15:11,600
Now go.

284
00:15:12,440 --> 00:15:13,240
Understood.

285
00:15:17,559 --> 00:15:18,440
No problem.

286
00:15:19,720 --> 00:15:22,679
That sound... It sounds amazing!

287
00:15:22,720 --> 00:15:23,480
Can you believe

288
00:15:23,480 --> 00:15:25,120
this is an antique from the '70s?

289
00:15:26,080 --> 00:15:27,879
Can I... Can I take it for a spin?

290
00:15:27,960 --> 00:15:29,120
Sure. Go ahead.

291
00:15:34,279 --> 00:15:38,039
Goddess, you look so cool on that bike!

292
00:15:39,000 --> 00:15:41,879
Man, aren't you curious how it feels?

293
00:15:42,279 --> 00:15:44,480
I only see my goddess, I'm not curious.

294
00:15:47,159 --> 00:15:48,559
Don't say I didn't warn you.

295
00:15:48,759 --> 00:15:50,240
Even though the paint was baked,

296
00:15:50,240 --> 00:15:51,279
it's not fully dry yet.

297
00:15:51,480 --> 00:15:52,440
Be careful.

298
00:15:55,519 --> 00:15:57,120
So, can I head back now?

299
00:15:57,159 --> 00:15:58,080
Of course not.

300
00:15:58,080 --> 00:15:59,559
I have to treat you to dinner.

301
00:15:59,799 --> 00:16:02,120
There's nothing good nearby, but still.

302
00:16:02,200 --> 00:16:03,080
When I have time,

303
00:16:03,080 --> 00:16:04,759
I'll cook you a perfect dinner.

304
00:16:05,279 --> 00:16:06,080
I think...

305
00:16:06,080 --> 00:16:08,159
I'd rather go back and eat Captain's food.

306
00:16:08,639 --> 00:16:09,639
Fine, let's head out together then.

307
00:16:27,519 --> 00:16:28,000
Are you sure

308
00:16:30,360 --> 00:16:31,679
this is really okay?

309
00:16:32,120 --> 00:16:32,919
No problem.

310
00:16:33,039 --> 00:16:35,919
I didn't expect Mr. Xiang to train me.

311
00:16:35,919 --> 00:16:36,600
That's awesome.

312
00:16:36,600 --> 00:16:37,279
Let's do this.

313
00:16:53,000 --> 00:16:54,360
Nice. One more time.

314
00:17:00,360 --> 00:17:01,159
Okay.

315
00:17:02,759 --> 00:17:04,720
If your husband ever does this to you,

316
00:17:04,720 --> 00:17:05,720
you hit him right like this.

317
00:17:06,279 --> 00:17:07,079
Okay.

318
00:17:07,279 --> 00:17:07,960
Let's practice once more.

319
00:17:07,960 --> 00:17:08,640
Okay.

320
00:17:13,720 --> 00:17:14,519
Let go!

321
00:17:17,240 --> 00:17:19,359
Touching my woman? You've got a death wish!

322
00:17:22,359 --> 00:17:23,039
Stop!

323
00:17:23,039 --> 00:17:24,319
Stop it! Stop fighting!

324
00:17:24,519 --> 00:17:25,960
Honey, stop!

325
00:17:26,000 --> 00:17:27,519
He's my training instructor!

326
00:17:27,599 --> 00:17:28,400
What training class?

327
00:17:28,400 --> 00:17:29,039
A class...

328
00:17:29,440 --> 00:17:31,079
...to put you in your place.

329
00:17:31,240 --> 00:17:33,079
And put an end to your domestic abuse.

330
00:17:33,279 --> 00:17:34,680
Domestic abuse?

331
00:17:34,920 --> 00:17:35,920
How is that possible?

332
00:17:35,960 --> 00:17:37,359
I love my wife very much.

333
00:17:39,000 --> 00:17:40,319
Then what about the bruises on her body?

334
00:17:40,319 --> 00:17:41,119
Where did they come from?

335
00:17:42,400 --> 00:17:44,920
Th-This was from an accidental fall.

336
00:17:49,440 --> 00:17:51,119
You threatened her, didn't you?

337
00:17:51,920 --> 00:17:52,920
What nonsense!

338
00:17:53,960 --> 00:17:55,039
Haven't I been good to you?

339
00:17:55,480 --> 00:17:56,960
My husband loves me very much.

340
00:17:57,079 --> 00:17:58,519
Honey, let's go.

341
00:17:59,200 --> 00:18:00,000
Let's go.

342
00:18:00,000 --> 00:18:00,640
Wait...

343
00:18:00,640 --> 00:18:01,319
Anda,

344
00:18:02,319 --> 00:18:03,519
she came to us for help.

345
00:18:03,559 --> 00:18:05,519
Now it looks like we're meddling!

346
00:18:06,240 --> 00:18:08,079
Even if we can offer help,

347
00:18:08,079 --> 00:18:10,319
the victim must want to fight for it.

348
00:18:38,519 --> 00:18:40,480
Ms. Dan, there's no one else here.

349
00:18:40,480 --> 00:18:41,559
You don't have to act like this,

350
00:18:41,799 --> 00:18:43,039
playing hard to get with me.

351
00:18:44,200 --> 00:18:47,680
I know you're interested in me, too.

352
00:18:50,279 --> 00:18:52,920
Sun Zhiguo, don't cross the line!

353
00:18:53,039 --> 00:18:54,480
Look at yourself right now.

354
00:18:54,480 --> 00:18:55,359
I'm warning you,

355
00:18:55,400 --> 00:18:56,759
if you keep this up, I'll call the police!

356
00:18:57,400 --> 00:19:00,440
Dan Feng, stop acting so high and mighty.

357
00:19:00,960 --> 00:19:01,960
Don't you forget,

358
00:19:02,039 --> 00:19:03,759
you wouldn't be here today without me.

359
00:19:04,599 --> 00:19:07,000
If I can't have you today,

360
00:19:07,000 --> 00:19:09,279
I'll drop your hotel's ranking!

361
00:19:09,279 --> 00:19:09,960
You... You...

362
00:19:11,880 --> 00:19:12,720
Sun Zhiguo!

363
00:19:17,640 --> 00:19:19,319
Sun Zhiguo, I'm warning you!

364
00:19:19,319 --> 00:19:20,640
My patience has its limits.

365
00:19:20,640 --> 00:19:21,359
If you keep pushing me,

366
00:19:21,359 --> 00:19:22,680
don't blame me for fighting back!

367
00:19:23,799 --> 00:19:26,279
Dan Feng, how dare you do this to me!

368
00:19:26,640 --> 00:19:28,559
I... I'll sue you for assault!

369
00:19:29,200 --> 00:19:31,920
I'll pull your hotel's recommendation!

370
00:19:32,000 --> 00:19:33,680
I'm... I'm not done with you!

371
00:19:54,759 --> 00:19:55,680
What's wrong, Anda?

372
00:19:56,519 --> 00:19:58,519
Having trouble adjusting to being back?

373
00:19:58,720 --> 00:19:59,519
Feeling tired?

374
00:20:00,319 --> 00:20:01,240
Not really.

375
00:20:01,559 --> 00:20:04,480
It's just that sometimes I think of

376
00:20:04,480 --> 00:20:05,920
things from Africa,

377
00:20:06,359 --> 00:20:07,759
and I just zone out for a bit.

378
00:20:09,079 --> 00:20:11,920
How about I take you out to unwind?

379
00:20:13,279 --> 00:20:14,480
I feel like having a drink.

380
00:20:15,200 --> 00:20:17,519
Sure, I'll join you.

381
00:20:32,480 --> 00:20:35,240
Anda, that's enough.

382
00:20:37,279 --> 00:20:38,920
I'm fine.

383
00:20:38,960 --> 00:20:42,680
I don't start work until ten tomorrow.

384
00:20:42,680 --> 00:20:45,160
I have an early meeting tomorrow morning.

385
00:20:46,279 --> 00:20:47,720
Then you go first.

386
00:20:48,519 --> 00:20:49,319
Anda.

387
00:20:50,519 --> 00:20:53,319
Let the past stay in the past.

388
00:20:53,519 --> 00:20:54,319
Right?

389
00:20:59,759 --> 00:21:01,119
I don't need your advice.

390
00:21:01,559 --> 00:21:04,880
Anda, this is China.

391
00:21:05,519 --> 00:21:07,240
Not Antilocaris.

392
00:21:08,400 --> 00:21:09,720
Now that you're back,

393
00:21:10,079 --> 00:21:13,920
give yourself another chance to start over.

394
00:21:15,839 --> 00:21:18,279
Let me call, call, call a cab for you.

395
00:21:19,319 --> 00:21:21,160
Don't call one. You...

396
00:21:21,440 --> 00:21:23,920
If you get a cab, just take it and leave.

397
00:21:26,680 --> 00:21:29,079
Fine, I won't call one.

398
00:21:29,680 --> 00:21:30,880
Can't get a cab anyway.

399
00:21:32,000 --> 00:21:34,319
Here, I'll keep you company.

400
00:21:52,319 --> 00:21:53,119
Bro!

401
00:21:54,039 --> 00:21:55,359
Bro, over here, over here. This way!

402
00:21:58,200 --> 00:21:59,119
Impressive!

403
00:21:59,240 --> 00:22:00,519
You actually took over this place!

404
00:22:00,519 --> 00:22:01,960
Not bad, huh? What do you think?

405
00:22:02,279 --> 00:22:03,079
Let me tell you,

406
00:22:03,319 --> 00:22:06,119
selling military surplus takes strategy.

407
00:22:06,319 --> 00:22:07,400
See, the people browsing here

408
00:22:07,400 --> 00:22:08,920
aren't all hardcore fans, right?

409
00:22:09,039 --> 00:22:10,319
Even if they are,

410
00:22:10,319 --> 00:22:12,720
they can't wear combat fatigues every day.

411
00:22:12,839 --> 00:22:15,079
So items with subtle military touches

412
00:22:15,440 --> 00:22:16,880
actually sell the best.

413
00:22:16,880 --> 00:22:17,640
Come check this out.

414
00:22:21,839 --> 00:22:23,279
This camo is pretty nice.

415
00:22:23,279 --> 00:22:24,200
You mean this one?

416
00:22:28,359 --> 00:22:29,200
This one, right?

417
00:22:31,799 --> 00:22:35,079
To tell you the truth, bro,

418
00:22:35,319 --> 00:22:37,039
I actually don't recognize it.

419
00:22:37,160 --> 00:22:38,680
When I bought it,

420
00:22:39,039 --> 00:22:41,079
I saw it was a bit different

421
00:22:41,079 --> 00:22:41,839
from other military camo,

422
00:22:41,839 --> 00:22:43,319
so I even bargained the price down.

423
00:22:43,319 --> 00:22:44,960
You don't even know this?

424
00:22:45,039 --> 00:22:46,960
Back when I was in the special forces,

425
00:22:47,279 --> 00:22:49,839
I wore this in the bushes every day,

426
00:22:49,839 --> 00:22:51,799
hiding out for a whole day,

427
00:22:52,079 --> 00:22:53,240
unable to move at all.

428
00:22:55,039 --> 00:22:57,680
Bro, you were in the special forces?

429
00:22:58,079 --> 00:22:59,039
For real?

430
00:23:01,799 --> 00:23:02,799
I'm just messing with you.

431
00:23:02,799 --> 00:23:04,839
Look at my build, how could I be?

432
00:23:05,119 --> 00:23:07,000
I can barely even handle daily workouts.

433
00:23:09,119 --> 00:23:09,920
Fair enough.

434
00:23:29,720 --> 00:23:30,759
Why did she drink so much?

435
00:23:31,480 --> 00:23:32,599
You didn't even try to stop her.

436
00:23:33,680 --> 00:23:34,799
I couldn't stop her.

437
00:23:37,839 --> 00:23:39,480
Is she heartbroken,

438
00:23:39,920 --> 00:23:41,599
or did something go wrong?

439
00:23:43,079 --> 00:23:44,039
She just can't forget

440
00:23:44,039 --> 00:23:45,960
the people and events in Antilocaris.

441
00:23:48,160 --> 00:23:49,440
She just needs some time.

442
00:23:56,119 --> 00:23:57,839
Come on, over here.

443
00:23:59,000 --> 00:24:00,160
Give me a hand.

444
00:24:01,519 --> 00:24:02,599
Easy, easy.

445
00:24:02,599 --> 00:24:03,200
Okay.

446
00:24:04,079 --> 00:24:04,799
Come on.

447
00:24:06,160 --> 00:24:07,400
Drink up.

448
00:24:17,839 --> 00:24:18,759
Wei Tian

449
00:24:20,160 --> 00:24:23,480
Xiang Bei, remember our morning meeting.

450
00:24:25,200 --> 00:24:28,160
Wei Tian, don't go.

451
00:25:18,759 --> 00:25:19,640
You're still here?

452
00:25:19,880 --> 00:25:20,680
You're awake.

453
00:25:21,880 --> 00:25:22,680
Yeah.

454
00:25:22,960 --> 00:25:25,240
My head is killing me. Why not stop me?

455
00:25:27,559 --> 00:25:29,200
Guests this early in the morning?

456
00:25:30,079 --> 00:25:31,640
I have no idea. Who'd come this early?

457
00:25:35,960 --> 00:25:36,759
Anda.

458
00:25:38,839 --> 00:25:40,359
What's wrong? Why the panic?

459
00:25:40,359 --> 00:25:41,119
Let me see.

460
00:25:41,400 --> 00:25:42,480
No, no, no, don't.

461
00:25:43,119 --> 00:25:43,920
Slow down, slow down.

462
00:25:44,000 --> 00:25:44,799
What's going on?

463
00:25:45,640 --> 00:25:46,440
Sit, sit.

464
00:25:46,799 --> 00:25:47,400
Lie down.

465
00:25:47,400 --> 00:25:48,279
What happened?

466
00:25:48,319 --> 00:25:49,400
Just lie down.

467
00:25:49,640 --> 00:25:51,039
Can't you just lie down?

468
00:25:51,039 --> 00:25:51,960
Someone's here.

469
00:25:52,039 --> 00:25:52,759
Okay, okay.

470
00:25:52,759 --> 00:25:54,160
Don't move around. Stay still.

471
00:25:55,279 --> 00:25:56,759
Open the door for Mom!

472
00:25:57,200 --> 00:25:58,000
Mom!

473
00:25:58,920 --> 00:25:59,880
What are you doing here?

474
00:26:00,240 --> 00:26:01,559
My precious daughter!

475
00:26:01,599 --> 00:26:03,359
You came all the way back from Africa,

476
00:26:05,400 --> 00:26:07,400
so how could I not rush over to see you?

477
00:26:07,880 --> 00:26:08,680
Have a seat.

478
00:26:08,759 --> 00:26:09,640
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

479
00:26:09,640 --> 00:26:10,960
I could have picked you up.

480
00:26:11,039 --> 00:26:12,559
I've got two working legs.

481
00:26:13,039 --> 00:26:14,799
Why would I need a ride?

482
00:26:15,039 --> 00:26:15,960
Well, take a seat.

483
00:26:15,960 --> 00:26:18,240
I'll go wash up and fix my hair.

484
00:26:19,920 --> 00:26:20,759
Anda.

485
00:26:23,119 --> 00:26:24,440
After sleeping all night,

486
00:26:25,359 --> 00:26:27,039
you haven't aired out the bedroom?

487
00:26:27,039 --> 00:26:28,640
No, no, Mom, Mom, Mom!

488
00:26:28,960 --> 00:26:29,960
I'll do it myself!

489
00:26:30,039 --> 00:26:31,799
I can open the window after changing.

490
00:26:32,119 --> 00:26:32,960
I'm... I...

491
00:26:32,960 --> 00:26:33,480
Let me do it.

492
00:26:33,480 --> 00:26:35,000
No, no, it's fine. You...

493
00:26:37,519 --> 00:26:38,319
Hello, Auntie.

494
00:26:46,480 --> 00:26:47,359
It's all my fault.

495
00:26:49,759 --> 00:26:51,079
I dropped by without giving notice.

496
00:26:51,079 --> 00:26:51,720
Mom...

497
00:26:52,160 --> 00:26:53,960
Sorry to interrupt your weekend rest.

498
00:26:54,400 --> 00:26:55,119
No, Auntie...

499
00:26:55,119 --> 00:26:56,640
Well, let me explain.

500
00:26:56,920 --> 00:26:58,039
Anda had too much to drink yesterday,

501
00:26:58,039 --> 00:26:59,359
so I was a bit worried

502
00:26:59,359 --> 00:27:00,359
and stayed to look after her.

503
00:27:01,799 --> 00:27:03,240
Looked after her all night, huh?

504
00:27:05,799 --> 00:27:08,920
Don't you have a morning meeting today?

505
00:27:08,920 --> 00:27:09,880
Hurry and get going.

506
00:27:09,960 --> 00:27:11,799
Right. Auntie, I'm busy, so I'll take off.

507
00:27:13,039 --> 00:27:14,480
Leaving in such a hurry?

508
00:27:16,200 --> 00:27:17,000
Anda.

509
00:27:18,279 --> 00:27:19,960
Look at your messy hair.

510
00:27:20,839 --> 00:27:21,640
Come here.

511
00:27:22,359 --> 00:27:24,960
Anda, go walk your boyfriend out.

512
00:27:25,279 --> 00:27:27,359
Actually, Auntie, Anda likes someone else.

513
00:27:28,960 --> 00:27:31,599
Well, I had to rush over today,

514
00:27:31,880 --> 00:27:33,680
but I'll treat you to a meal next time.

515
00:27:35,160 --> 00:27:35,960
All right, sounds good.

516
00:27:37,079 --> 00:27:39,480
Come visit often when you're free.

517
00:27:39,559 --> 00:27:40,680
Okay, well...

518
00:27:41,119 --> 00:27:42,799
Auntie, I've got things to do, so I'll take off.

519
00:27:43,599 --> 00:27:44,480
I'll walk him out.

520
00:27:45,759 --> 00:27:46,599
Go ahead and walk him out.

521
00:27:47,119 --> 00:27:47,920
Goodbye, Auntie.

522
00:27:52,160 --> 00:27:52,960
Come here.

523
00:27:55,599 --> 00:27:57,839
Tell Mom, who is that guy?

524
00:27:57,839 --> 00:27:59,640
Well, Xiang Bei.

525
00:27:59,839 --> 00:28:00,640
Xiang Bei?

526
00:28:02,799 --> 00:28:03,759
He's nice.

527
00:28:05,480 --> 00:28:06,359
How are things going?

528
00:28:07,559 --> 00:28:11,359
I... I need to wash up.

529
00:28:12,319 --> 00:28:13,119
Xiang Bei...

530
00:28:15,039 --> 00:28:17,359
All right, that concludes today's meeting.

531
00:28:17,359 --> 00:28:18,559
That's all from me.

532
00:28:18,559 --> 00:28:19,599
Are there any questions?

533
00:28:22,359 --> 00:28:25,480
Good. Here's to completing our mission successfully.

534
00:28:25,480 --> 00:28:26,200
Meeting adjourned.

535
00:28:38,839 --> 00:28:39,640
What's up?

536
00:28:41,519 --> 00:28:43,079
I heard someone

537
00:28:43,079 --> 00:28:45,440
spent the night at Anda's.

538
00:28:46,960 --> 00:28:48,400
A man and a woman, all alone...

539
00:28:48,880 --> 00:28:50,200
Nothing happened?

540
00:28:51,279 --> 00:28:52,319
Two grown men,

541
00:28:52,319 --> 00:28:53,559
and you're this gossipy?

542
00:28:54,599 --> 00:28:55,599
I just want to know.

543
00:28:55,839 --> 00:28:57,480
Did you really not go home last night?

544
00:28:57,599 --> 00:28:59,519
Yeah, and there's a witness.

545
00:28:59,519 --> 00:29:01,079
Anda doesn't count.

546
00:29:01,559 --> 00:29:02,799
It was her mom.

547
00:29:02,799 --> 00:29:03,599
Who?

548
00:29:04,240 --> 00:29:05,279
Her mom.

549
00:29:05,759 --> 00:29:07,279
Her mom?

550
00:29:11,319 --> 00:29:12,119
Dan Feng,

551
00:29:13,039 --> 00:29:15,880
there's something I need you to explain.

552
00:29:16,759 --> 00:29:18,359
Why is it that this morning,

553
00:29:18,680 --> 00:29:19,880
Qifeng Travel

554
00:29:19,880 --> 00:29:21,759
suddenly pulled us from their rankings

555
00:29:21,759 --> 00:29:22,799
out of nowhere,

556
00:29:23,279 --> 00:29:25,480
and shut down all our booking links?

557
00:29:28,200 --> 00:29:30,599
I don't care to explain this any further.

558
00:29:31,440 --> 00:29:33,200
Qifeng Travel's rankings,

559
00:29:33,200 --> 00:29:34,720
and everything tied to them,

560
00:29:34,720 --> 00:29:35,599
have been handled by

561
00:29:35,599 --> 00:29:37,240
a completely vile person.

562
00:29:37,880 --> 00:29:40,039
We're better off without that ranking.

563
00:29:40,880 --> 00:29:41,680
Besides,

564
00:29:41,920 --> 00:29:43,759
for all these years, Plato Hotel

565
00:29:43,759 --> 00:29:45,200
has built its name on word of mouth.

566
00:29:45,200 --> 00:29:45,839
We have such—

567
00:29:45,839 --> 00:29:46,759
Enough, already!

568
00:29:47,640 --> 00:29:49,160
